<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" ?>
<tt xml:lang="en" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" ttp:profile="http://www.w3.org/TR/profile/sdp-us" >
<head>
<styling>
<style xml:id="s1" tts:textAlign="center" tts:extent="90% 90%" tts:origin="5% 5%" tts:displayAlign="after"/>
<style xml:id="s2" tts:fontSize=".72c" tts:backgroundColor="black" tts:color="white"/>
</styling>
<layout>
<region xml:id="r1" style="s1"/>
</layout>
</head>
<body region="r1">
<div>
<p begin="00:00:00.320" end="00:00:04.080" style="s2">Sir, my father is running out of time. <br />There&#39;s £5 million on this card. Please,  </p>
<p begin="00:00:04.080" end="00:00:12.400" style="s2">just pass on my message. Dad, get up. I can tell <br />you&#39;re a good son. Keep your money. I don&#39;t need  </p>
<p begin="00:00:12.400" end="00:00:20.000" style="s2">it. This isn&#39;t quite right. Your father isn&#39;t <br />sick. [music] His soul&#39;s candle wick is burning  </p>
<p begin="00:00:20.000" end="00:00:27.840" style="s2">out. We call it silver candle syndrome. What <br />nonsense. Sir, please. You must introduce me  </p>
<p begin="00:00:27.840" end="00:00:32.080" style="s2">to the archmite. Rumor says the new archmeister <br />single-handedly suppressed a sea dragon during a  </p>
<p begin="00:00:32.080" end="00:00:37.440" style="s2">North Sea storm. [music] Even stronger than Master <br />Ober. He must have a way to save my father. Dad,  </p>
<p begin="00:00:37.440" end="00:00:40.560" style="s2">that&#39;s absurd. Exactly. [music] There&#39;s <br />no such thing as magic in this world. You  </p>
<p begin="00:00:40.560" end="00:00:44.880" style="s2">should trust science. If you&#39;re sick, take <br />medicine. Give this to your father. He&#39;ll  </p>
<p begin="00:00:44.880" end="00:00:52.800" style="s2">be fine. Will this really work? I&#39;ve given <br />it to you. What you do with it is up to you.</p>
<p begin="00:00:54.480" end="00:00:59.760" style="s2">The abyss stirs and the dragon <br />wakes. Raven Tower has guarded  </p>
<p begin="00:00:59.760" end="00:01:19.760" style="s2">these seas for 700 years and tonight <br />it won&#39;t make it past Black Cliff.</p>
<p begin="00:01:32.320" end="00:01:45.360" style="s2">Guess I&#39;m getting old now. Even a baby sea <br />serpent is getting to me. Need a hand, master?</p>
<p begin="00:01:45.360" end="00:01:50.000" style="s2">Were</p>
<p begin="00:01:50.000" end="00:01:55.200" style="s2">you waiting for that thing to eat me <br />first? You just handed me the arch  </p>
<p begin="00:01:55.200" end="00:02:01.280" style="s2">maester&#39;s ring. I had to admire how good it <br />looked on me first. You little brat. Archae,  </p>
<p begin="00:02:01.280" end="00:02:09.280" style="s2">can you two argue later? That <br />dragon&#39;s about to hit the tower.</p>
<p begin="00:02:12.680" end="00:02:13.680" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:02:13.680" end="00:02:29.600" style="s2">This sword can split mountains, part the <br />sea, banish evil, and cut dragons to pieces.</p>
<p begin="00:02:29.600" end="00:02:35.760" style="s2">Might as well make my first day <br />as arch master unforgettable.</p>
<p begin="00:02:49.360" end="00:02:53.840" style="s2">And we&#39;re done. You okay, master? I showed <br />up just in time. Don&#39;t I at least deserve a  </p>
<p begin="00:02:53.840" end="00:03:02.240" style="s2">compliment? Sure. Starting tomorrow, you&#39;re <br />sweeping the tower steps for a month. Huh?</p>
<p begin="00:03:15.840" end="00:03:19.680" style="s2">master really holds a grudge. He lost to  </p>
<p begin="00:03:19.680" end="00:03:30.560" style="s2">the sea [music] dragon. Now I&#39;m <br />stuck sweeping leaves. [snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:03:30.560" end="00:03:35.840" style="s2">Sir, you&#39;re one of London&#39;s most respected family <br />heads. You and Miss Ashfield came here in person,  </p>
<p begin="00:03:35.840" end="00:03:41.120" style="s2">and no one&#39;s even here to greet us. Raven <br />Tower [music] isn&#39;t some VIP club. Its mages  </p>
<p begin="00:03:41.120" end="00:03:48.480" style="s2">have protected the crown and defended London <br />through its darkest wars. Watch your tongue.</p>
<p begin="00:03:48.480" end="00:03:52.240" style="s2">Dad, Grandpa&#39;s in the ICU. The doctors <br />are waiting for our decision. Why are  </p>
<p begin="00:03:52.240" end="00:03:56.640" style="s2">we here? To pray for him. We&#39;re here to <br />meet the new arch maest. Modern medicine  </p>
<p begin="00:03:56.640" end="00:04:01.120" style="s2">can&#39;t save your grandfather anymore. <br />Dad, Grandpa needs a good doctor,  </p>
<p begin="00:04:01.120" end="00:04:19.840" style="s2">not someone in a robe chanting spells. A true <br />arch is far more than a man who casts spells.</p>
<p begin="00:04:19.840" end="00:04:25.280" style="s2">Excuse me, young man. Is the <br />new arch major the tower?</p>
<p begin="00:04:28.080" end="00:04:32.880" style="s2">What do you want? My father has developed a <br />strange illness. Experts in London, Zurich,  </p>
<p begin="00:04:32.880" end="00:04:36.160" style="s2">and New York have all examined him, and none <br />[music] of them can explain it. I&#39;ve heard  </p>
<p begin="00:04:36.160" end="00:04:42.000" style="s2">Raven Tower&#39;s Archmite is skilled in ancient <br />medicine alchemy. I came to request a cure. Dad,  </p>
<p begin="00:04:42.000" end="00:04:46.640" style="s2">you&#39;re really planning to seek medicine from <br />an old tower. At best, they brew [music] herbal  </p>
<p begin="00:04:46.640" end="00:04:53.360" style="s2">tea. What they know about real medicine? Yeah, <br />exactly. Go see a doctor instead. Why come here?  </p>
<p begin="00:04:53.360" end="00:04:57.360" style="s2">Half the time our elevator doesn&#39;t even <br />work. You don&#39;t understand. Raven Tower  </p>
<p begin="00:04:57.360" end="00:05:02.000" style="s2">has saved lives that modern medicine couldn&#39;t <br />even explain. Sir, please just inform the Arkm  </p>
<p begin="00:05:02.000" end="00:05:06.320" style="s2">for me. No can do. The Arkmish is busy. He <br />doesn&#39;t see visitors. He didn&#39;t even check the  </p>
<p begin="00:05:06.320" end="00:05:11.440" style="s2">patient&#39;s record and just handed over a random <br />bottle. What if [music] it&#39;s poisonous? Dad,  </p>
<p begin="00:05:11.440" end="00:05:17.200" style="s2">we should go back to the hospital. <br />Get another specialist consultation.</p>
<p begin="00:05:17.200" end="00:05:22.400" style="s2">This is our last chance. No matter <br />what, I have to meet the arch.  </p>
<p begin="00:05:22.400" end="00:05:36.000" style="s2">Sir, sir, please introduce me to the Ark.</p>
<p begin="00:05:36.000" end="00:05:41.120" style="s2">Oh my god.</p>
<p begin="00:05:41.120" end="00:05:49.760" style="s2">Dad, where did that janitor go? He just flew away. <br />What? The staff. I see what&#39;s going on, sir. You  </p>
<p begin="00:05:49.760" end="00:05:54.480" style="s2">think he&#39;s a fraud, too, right? He just handed you <br />some unknown bottle and told you to take it back  </p>
<p begin="00:05:54.480" end="00:06:00.000" style="s2">for the old master. That&#39;s basically poisoning <br />him. Give me the bottle. I&#39;ll dispose of it.  </p>
<p begin="00:06:00.000" end="00:06:06.560" style="s2">Shut up. That man was not a fraud. He is the true <br />Grandmaster. Dad&#39;s going to make it. Grandmaster?  </p>
<p begin="00:06:06.560" end="00:06:16.880" style="s2">How powerful is he supposed to be? Powerful enough <br />to fly into the clouds. Now, back to the estate.</p>
<p begin="00:06:24.000" end="00:06:30.640" style="s2">Master, now that I&#39;ve taken the arch mage <br />ring, with things at the tower under your care,  </p>
<p begin="00:06:30.640" end="00:06:35.920" style="s2">I&#39;d like to head down the mountain [music] <br />for a while. I know you act like a slacker  </p>
<p begin="00:06:35.920" end="00:06:43.200" style="s2">on the outside, but you&#39;ve never forgotten <br />the Gray family&#39;s tragedy 10 years ago.</p>
<p begin="00:06:45.280" end="00:06:50.480" style="s2">Your enemy is the Blackthorn Ducal House, one of <br />the most dangerous witch hunting noble families  </p>
<p begin="00:06:50.480" end="00:06:55.040" style="s2">in existence. Behind them is half [music] of <br />the Underground Council. I didn&#39;t let you go  </p>
<p begin="00:06:55.040" end="00:07:02.160" style="s2">before because I didn&#39;t want you to die. I <br />understand, master. Yet, in just 10 years,  </p>
<p begin="00:07:02.160" end="00:07:08.320" style="s2">you&#39;ve achieved what others couldn&#39;t complete <br />in a century. You are now the only archad in  </p>
<p begin="00:07:08.320" end="00:07:15.840" style="s2">seven centuries who can hear the echo of the star <br />law. Go find the truth behind that massacre. The  </p>
<p begin="00:07:15.840" end="00:07:24.480" style="s2">Black Thorns and everyone under them. None of them <br />are getting away. Remember, the world isn&#39;t only  </p>
<p begin="00:07:24.480" end="00:07:30.880" style="s2">hatred. There is also love. 10 years ago, when I <br />traveled down the mountain, I made a blood oath  </p>
<p begin="00:07:30.880" end="00:07:35.760" style="s2">marriage contract for you with the daughter of <br />House Hawthorne. You&#39;ll go and fulfill it. Are  </p>
<p begin="00:07:35.760" end="00:07:43.200" style="s2">you a matchmaker now? This is a Star-Law witnessed <br />marriage contract, not some ordinary arrangement.  </p>
<p begin="00:07:43.200" end="00:07:54.480" style="s2">And I hear the girl is quite beautiful. You won&#39;t <br />lose out. Now you sound just like a matchmaker.</p>
<p begin="00:07:54.480" end="00:08:01.120" style="s2">You little brat. Once you settle down, remember <br />your duty as Arch Maze. You don&#39;t just protect the  </p>
<p begin="00:08:01.120" end="00:08:29.280" style="s2">tower. You protect everyone living beyond its <br />walls. Relax. I know what I&#39;m doing. I&#39;m off.</p>
<p begin="00:08:29.280" end="00:08:32.560" style="s2">Why is it that janitor again?</p>
<p begin="00:08:34.160" end="00:08:38.720" style="s2">What is he doing here?</p>
<p begin="00:08:38.720" end="00:08:44.080" style="s2">So, my fianceé should be in there.</p>
<p begin="00:08:44.080" end="00:08:48.880" style="s2">All right, I&#39;m on my [music] way.</p>
<p begin="00:08:48.880" end="00:08:51.760" style="s2">With this 1 billion wind power <br />contract from the Ashford Group,  </p>
<p begin="00:08:51.760" end="00:08:56.640" style="s2">the Hawthorne family has finally secured <br />its place in London&#39;s energy sector. And  </p>
<p begin="00:08:56.640" end="00:09:00.000" style="s2">it&#39;s all thanks to Lord Blair. Lord Bla <br />is one of the Ashford family&#39;s direct  </p>
<p begin="00:09:00.000" end="00:09:08.480" style="s2">heirs. [music] Once you&#39;re engaged, we&#39;ll <br />finally break into the real old money world.</p>
<p begin="00:09:08.480" end="00:09:14.560" style="s2">How did a [music] castle janitor get in <br />here? Hello, my name&#39;s [music] Arthur.  </p>
<p begin="00:09:14.560" end="00:09:20.720" style="s2">I&#39;m here to fulfill a marriage contract. A <br />marriage contract? My master says that the  </p>
<p begin="00:09:20.720" end="00:09:26.160" style="s2">previous head of the Hawthor family arranged <br />a contract between me and Cecilia. [music]</p>
<p begin="00:09:26.160" end="00:09:29.840" style="s2">You think you can just walk into high <br />society and [music] claim a marriage?  </p>
<p begin="00:09:29.840" end="00:09:36.080" style="s2">Go back and clean floors. I don&#39;t clean floors. <br />I sweep stairs. There&#39;s a difference. Then  </p>
<p begin="00:09:36.080" end="00:09:39.680" style="s2">go marry your stairs. You&#39;re way out of <br />your league with me. Don&#39;t get it wrong.  </p>
<p begin="00:09:39.680" end="00:09:44.400" style="s2">I&#39;m not here out of love. I&#39;m here out of <br />responsibility. This contract is witnessed  </p>
<p begin="00:09:44.400" end="00:09:53.360" style="s2">by the Star Law. If I don&#39;t show up, the <br />HTOR family will face [music] consequences.</p>
<p begin="00:09:53.360" end="00:09:58.640" style="s2">This is indeed father&#39;s handwriting. <br />What? Did my grandfather lose his mind?  </p>
<p begin="00:09:58.640" end="00:10:11.600" style="s2">He actually promised me to some broke mage <br />from a castle. I refuse this marriage.</p>
<p begin="00:10:11.600" end="00:10:16.880" style="s2">Brother, father is in this condition and you <br />disappear all day. Were you out arranging your  </p>
<p begin="00:10:16.880" end="00:10:24.160" style="s2">inheritance? Uncle, the person most desperate <br />for the inheritance durence is obvious to all.  </p>
<p begin="00:10:24.160" end="00:10:29.840" style="s2">I went to Raven Tower to ask for a cure for <br />father. Even the royal medical advisers can  </p>
<p begin="00:10:29.840" end="00:10:37.440" style="s2">do nothing for him. And you went to <br />a haunted old tower and got a cure.</p>
<p begin="00:10:37.440" end="00:10:41.440" style="s2">The archman didn&#39;t see us. The medicine <br />was given by a young man sweeping the  </p>
<p begin="00:10:41.440" end="00:10:47.040" style="s2">floors. What? You actually brought back <br />something from a janitor? Are you trying  </p>
<p begin="00:10:47.040" end="00:10:54.960" style="s2">to kill father? He is not an ordinary man. He&#39;s <br />a great mage. This medicine, it&#39;s a potion. Dad,  </p>
<p begin="00:10:54.960" end="00:11:02.160" style="s2">are you sure? I saw him ride a staff straight <br />into the clouds. This has to be the real thing.  </p>
<p begin="00:11:02.160" end="00:11:11.040" style="s2">If you say things like that in public, people <br />will think you&#39;ve been scammed. Let them be.</p>
<p begin="00:11:11.040" end="00:11:17.040" style="s2">Stop. As an Ashund, I refuse to let you make <br />father take something we don&#39;t even know. I&#39;m  </p>
<p begin="00:11:17.040" end="00:11:24.160" style="s2">saving his life. Who knows what you&#39;re planning? <br />Uncle, how can you say that? You and Blair are  </p>
<p begin="00:11:24.160" end="00:11:30.720" style="s2">the ones trying to take control of the family. <br />Fine if you [music] insist. But if grandfather  </p>
<p begin="00:11:30.720" end="00:11:37.360" style="s2">doesn&#39;t wake up, we know who to blame. What the <br />hell do you want? If grandfather doesn&#39;t wake up,  </p>
<p begin="00:11:37.360" end="00:11:41.840" style="s2">Evelyn steps down as CEO and the head of <br />the [music] family position goes to my  </p>
<p begin="00:11:41.840" end="00:11:46.160" style="s2">father. Exactly. Only if you agree to those <br />terms do you get to try anything on father.  </p>
<p begin="00:11:46.160" end="00:11:51.200" style="s2">No. That&#39;s outrageous. [music] I agree. Dad, <br />you know what they&#39;re like. If you hand the  </p>
<p begin="00:11:51.200" end="00:11:54.480" style="s2">Ashford family to them, they&#39;ll ruin it <br />before you know it. I believe that young  </p>
<p begin="00:11:54.480" end="00:12:08.320" style="s2">man. [music] He wouldn&#39;t trick a man who was <br />on his knees pleading for his father&#39;s life.</p>
<p begin="00:12:08.320" end="00:12:15.760" style="s2">Dad, it doesn&#39;t [music] look like the medicine is <br />working. Just wait a little longer. Wait for what,  </p>
<p begin="00:12:15.760" end="00:12:21.360" style="s2">Roland? It&#39;s time for you to retire. And that CEO <br />seat is mine now. My dad meant well. Grandfather  </p>
<p begin="00:12:21.360" end="00:12:28.240" style="s2">took the medicine and didn&#39;t get worse, so it <br />can&#39;t be harmful. Stop making trouble. Enough  </p>
<p begin="00:12:28.240" end="00:12:32.800" style="s2">nonsense. Either you honor your promise or I&#39;ll <br />make sure you don&#39;t even have a room left in  </p>
<p begin="00:12:32.800" end="00:12:39.440" style="s2">the Asheville family. I saw it. That young man <br />flew into the sky. Dad, please calm down. Even  </p>
<p begin="00:12:39.440" end="00:12:44.080" style="s2">he said it himself. Trust science. Thinking of <br />going back on your word? I control the biggest  </p>
<p begin="00:12:44.080" end="00:12:49.760" style="s2">contract in the family now. The board is already <br />waiting for my signal. Hand over Ashfold or you  </p>
<p begin="00:12:49.760" end="00:12:57.360" style="s2">walk away with nothing. Blair, don&#39;t you push <br />your luck. [sighs and panting] I always keep  </p>
<p begin="00:12:57.360" end="00:13:11.280" style="s2">my word. If you want the company, then prove you <br />deserve it. So, you&#39;re going back on your word.</p>
<p begin="00:13:18.080" end="00:13:31.040" style="s2">Grandfather. [music]</p>
<p begin="00:13:31.040" end="00:13:36.720" style="s2">Dad, you&#39;re awake. Thank God. I knew the medicine <br />would work. That young man is no ordinary person.  </p>
<p begin="00:13:36.720" end="00:13:40.080" style="s2">I [music] didn&#39;t expect the medicine in that <br />bottle could save someone at death&#39;s door.  </p>
<p begin="00:13:40.640" end="00:13:46.240" style="s2">What young man? What medicine? This is the raven <br />soul revive elixir once refined by the former arch  </p>
<p begin="00:13:46.240" end="00:13:52.240" style="s2">mage of Raidman Tower. And this is black raven <br />wax. You met Master Oberin at the tower? No,  </p>
<p begin="00:13:52.240" end="00:13:56.560" style="s2">the medicine was given by a young sweeping <br />the stairs. Said my father&#39;s devotion moved  </p>
<p begin="00:13:56.560" end="00:14:00.880" style="s2">him. If it wasn&#39;t Master Oberin himself, then it <br />must be the royal medical adviser I hired. Yes,  </p>
<p begin="00:14:00.880" end="00:14:04.960" style="s2">that adviser is even insulted by the royal <br />family. My dad went all the way to the North Sea,  </p>
<p begin="00:14:04.960" end="00:14:08.960" style="s2">knelt outside that that tower, and begged for <br />help. And now you&#39;re trying to take credit.  </p>
<p begin="00:14:08.960" end="00:14:12.960" style="s2">You insolent fool. How dare you insult <br />the judgment of a man who has seen real  </p>
<p begin="00:14:12.960" end="00:14:26.960" style="s2">magic and who just forced your father <br />to resign. You and your father get out.</p>
<p begin="00:14:26.960" end="00:14:31.600" style="s2">What are you looking at? Keep staring and you&#39;re <br />fired. That old man actually survived. Forget  </p>
<p begin="00:14:31.600" end="00:14:37.280" style="s2">it. I&#39;m already pissed off. Might as well go find <br />Cecilia. She knows how to make people feel better.  </p>
<p begin="00:14:38.640" end="00:14:45.120" style="s2">The old master has awakened. There&#39;s something <br />I must report at once. Arrange a flight to  </p>
<p begin="00:14:45.120" end="00:14:50.160" style="s2">Raven Tower. We need to thank that young man <br />properly. No need. I saw him at the Golden Rose  </p>
<p begin="00:14:50.160" end="00:14:59.600" style="s2">Hotel earlier. Probably there for the Hawthorne <br />banquet. The Hawthorne banquet? Come on, let&#39;s go.</p>
<p begin="00:14:59.600" end="00:15:04.640" style="s2">Arthur, what were you thinking? You expect me <br />to marry my daughter off based on a piece of  </p>
<p begin="00:15:04.640" end="00:15:08.880" style="s2">parchment? So, you&#39;re planning to break the <br />contract? What? Now, a broken mage thinks he  </p>
<p begin="00:15:08.880" end="00:15:14.160" style="s2">gets a say in my marriage. Marriage is about <br />status. And Cecilia is far too valuable for  </p>
<p begin="00:15:14.160" end="00:15:18.640" style="s2">a floor sweeping mage like you. As I said, I&#39;m <br />not really interested in her. I&#39;m here only to  </p>
<p begin="00:15:18.640" end="00:15:23.840" style="s2">honor the contract to spare you a disaster. How <br />dare you? Let me make this clear. Cecilia will  </p>
<p begin="00:15:23.840" end="00:15:28.880" style="s2">marry Lord Blair and she will become part of the <br />Ashford family. Blair, bring Edgar out here. Don&#39;t  </p>
<p begin="00:15:28.880" end="00:15:36.000" style="s2">you dare disrespect my my grandfather. Get over <br />yourself. Today&#39;s a celebration banquet for a  </p>
