<p begin="01:02:58.520" end="01:02:59.520" style="s2">[sighs]</p>
<p begin="01:02:59.520" end="01:03:07.360" style="s2">Yes. Thank you, Mr. Arthur. So, you were <br />saying I didn&#39;t catch that clearly? Oh,  </p>
<p begin="01:03:07.360" end="01:03:13.520" style="s2">no, Mr. Arthur. A huge and misunderstanding. <br />And I&#39;d do anything to make it up to you. Why  </p>
