<p begin="01:03:23.280" end="01:03:35.360" style="s2">people were acting pretty aggressive. That <br />doesn&#39;t sound like I&#39;m going to understand.</p>
<p begin="01:03:35.360" end="01:03:40.320" style="s2">Get this stupid son of a out of <br />here and break his legs. Chairman,  </p>
