<p begin="01:04:00.720" end="01:04:08.480" style="s2">Drake. He would never stand a chance. That&#39;s <br />impossible. Arthur is so young. How could he  </p>
<p begin="01:04:08.480" end="01:04:23.120" style="s2">be stronger than Drake? Mr. Arthur, did this dog <br />also disrespect you? Should I break his leg, too?</p>
<p begin="01:04:23.120" end="01:04:27.520" style="s2">Drake, I&#39;m with Blackthornne now. If you touch me,  </p>
