<p begin="01:06:13.200" end="01:06:21.120" style="s2">this place. Since we&#39;re already here, <br />we might as well collect some interest.</p>
<p begin="01:06:21.120" end="01:06:28.480" style="s2">But I can feel everyone&#39;s sincerity. <br />After careful consideration,  </p>
<p begin="01:06:28.480" end="01:06:38.880" style="s2">Blackthone has decided the Ashford <br />Group will be the chosen partner.</p>
<p begin="01:06:38.880" end="01:06:46.560" style="s2">Mr. Joseph Ashfield, the contract is here. You are <br />tonight&#39;s fortunate winner. Sign it. Mr. Grant,  </p>
