<p begin="01:08:07.920" end="01:08:15.200" style="s2">Blackthornne&#39;s will is worthless to me. <br />[music] You insult Blackthornne, you&#39;re dead.</p>
<p begin="01:08:15.200" end="01:08:20.800" style="s2">Grant may only be a branch member, but at <br />30, he&#39;s already a highrank sacred GR knight.  </p>
