<p begin="01:08:49.480" end="01:08:54.320" style="s2">[music] Is he insane? He tore up a Blackthorn <br />contract, injured a Blackthorn branch member,  </p>
<p begin="01:08:54.320" end="01:09:01.280" style="s2">and now he&#39;s even provoking the main family. <br />What&#39;s wrong with him? He&#39;s clearly skilled.  </p>
