<p begin="01:10:10.320" end="01:10:14.960" style="s2">against Blackthornne is a death sentence. <br />Arthur, he&#39;s not afraid of Blackthornne.  </p>
<p begin="01:10:15.840" end="01:10:23.760" style="s2">He&#39;s young and reckless, and so are you. You <br />know exactly how powerful Blackstone is. Father,  </p>
