<p begin="01:13:21.280" end="01:13:28.960" style="s2">now if I want. Behave yourself. And I might even <br />give you another chance to be Blackthornne&#39;s dog.</p>
<p begin="01:13:31.680" end="01:13:41.440" style="s2">A filthish stray like you doesn&#39;t get to touch my <br />wife. Perfect. Arthur actually has nerve to hit  </p>
<p begin="01:13:41.440" end="01:13:46.320" style="s2">Mr. Damian. He&#39;s a dead man walking now. I was <br />honestly worried for a second that Damian might  </p>
<p begin="01:13:46.320" end="01:13:51.280" style="s2">get distracted by that woman. Thank God. Once <br />Blackthornne gets angry, the entire London port  </p>
<p begin="01:13:51.280" end="01:13:59.120" style="s2">will bleed and everything Ashford owns will be <br />mine. You&#39;re finally going to make it, Blair. You  </p>
