<p begin="01:15:48.320" end="01:15:58.000" style="s2">I&#39;m staying with you. Nonsense. You&#39;re not a <br />knight. If [music] you stay, we&#39;ll be distracted.</p>
<p begin="01:15:58.000" end="01:16:02.320" style="s2">Don&#39;t worry. I&#39;m not letting you <br />become a widow this young. Be careful,  </p>
<p begin="01:16:02.320" end="01:16:13.600" style="s2">everyone. I&#39;ll be waiting <br />at home. Take her home now.</p>
