<p begin="01:18:00.400" end="01:18:06.160" style="s2">I&#39;m invincible. H above it, I&#39;ll <br />take one down with me. Those old  </p>
<p begin="01:18:06.160" end="01:18:15.280" style="s2">fools really think they&#39;re untouchable. <br />Show them what real powerhouses look like.</p>
<p begin="01:18:15.280" end="01:18:18.480" style="s2">Those direct guard elites are half <br />step blood moon. Way beyond the last  </p>
<p begin="01:18:18.480" end="01:18:24.480" style="s2">wave. Even one-on-one. I wouldn&#39;t stand <br />a chance. So, we&#39;re all doomed. Relax.  </p>
<p begin="01:18:24.480" end="01:18:29.840" style="s2">Even if Conrad came himself, I could <br />crush him with one hand. Not alone,  </p>
<p begin="01:18:29.840" end="01:18:42.613" style="s2">these nobies. Break his limbs first. I want <br />to watch him suffer. [screaming] [groaning]</p>
<p begin="01:18:42.613" end="01:18:46.480" style="s2">[screaming]</p>
<p begin="01:18:46.480" end="01:18:51.040" style="s2">How did he do that?</p>
<p begin="01:18:51.040" end="01:18:57.760" style="s2">What kind of monster is he? Weren&#39;t you going <br />to break my limbs? Weren&#39;t you going to make me  </p>
<p begin="01:18:57.760" end="01:19:04.160" style="s2">suffer? Why in a hurry to leave? What the hell do <br />you want to kill you? Arthur, don&#39;t be reckless.  </p>
<p begin="01:19:04.160" end="01:19:08.800" style="s2">Damian is Conrad&#39;s most beloved son. If you kill <br />him, Blackthrone will come after us for good.  </p>
<p begin="01:19:08.800" end="01:19:14.320" style="s2">My father is the Blackthor Grand Duke. If you <br />touch me, he&#39;ll tear you apart. Don&#39;t worry. He  </p>
