<p begin="01:19:29.920" end="01:19:42.960" style="s2">every last [music] one of you. Remember this. The <br />one who kills you is Arthur of the Gray family.</p>
<p begin="01:19:42.960" end="01:19:49.280" style="s2">Gray? Gray? Who? You. You&#39;re from that Gray <br />family. [music] The remnants of the Western Gray  </p>
