<p begin="01:19:54.720" end="01:20:01.440" style="s2">don&#39;t kill me. I can return the Raven King&#39;s sword <br />to you. I&#39;ll take it back from Conrad myself. Just  </p>
<p begin="01:20:01.440" end="01:20:09.680" style="s2">give me a chance. I&#39;ll make things right. Don&#39;t <br />be afraid. You won&#39;t be alone. Soon Conrad will  </p>
<p begin="01:20:09.680" end="01:20:18.640" style="s2">join you. The Blackthorns will all die. Oh no. Mr. <br />Damian just died here. This is going to shake all  </p>
<p begin="01:20:18.640" end="01:20:23.680" style="s2">of London. He&#39;s insane. [laughter] Blackthornne <br />is the most terrifying witch hunting juke family  </p>
<p begin="01:20:23.680" end="01:20:31.360" style="s2">in the north. If Blackthone goes all out, half <br />of England will run red. Ashford is finished.  </p>
<p begin="01:20:31.360" end="01:20:41.200" style="s2">Mr. Arthur, you went too far. Damian can&#39;t die. <br />The entire Blackthrone family deserves to die.</p>
<p begin="01:20:41.200" end="01:20:51.840" style="s2">[panting] He&#39;s dead. You killed him. <br />How dare you? Go tell Conrad. The Gray  </p>
