<p begin="01:21:54.480" end="01:22:00.480" style="s2">We know you&#39;re strong, but tell us the truth. <br />Just how strong are you? At the end of mystic  </p>
<p begin="01:22:00.480" end="01:22:10.320" style="s2">arts lies the Stargate. Open it and even the old <br />gods can be pierced by one finger. The old gods.</p>
