<p begin="01:22:14.960" end="01:22:29.200" style="s2">So some in this world can really step <br />into [music] the realm of the old gods.</p>
<p begin="01:22:29.200" end="01:22:40.560" style="s2">Your grace. Your grace. What <br />the hell is that? Get rid of it.</p>
