<p begin="01:26:18.840" end="01:26:25.040" style="s2">[snorts]</p>
<p begin="01:26:25.040" end="01:26:30.960" style="s2">Father, did Arthur put you under some kind <br />of spell? Nonsense. Arthur would do no such  </p>
