<p begin="01:28:21.200" end="01:28:35.520" style="s2">don&#39;t. That&#39;s a real silver wolf token. Father, <br />please. It&#39;s useless now. How can I just stand by?</p>
<p begin="01:28:35.520" end="01:28:44.240" style="s2">First, I&#39;ll crush this thing. <br />Then, I&#39;ll interrogate that fraud.</p>
<p begin="01:28:44.240" end="01:28:49.400" style="s2">Stop. [screaming]</p>
<p begin="01:29:00.800" end="01:29:09.680" style="s2">Let her go.</p>
<p begin="01:29:09.680" end="01:29:18.640" style="s2">Simon, are you trying to rebel? Mr. Gareth, <br />I was just handling a fraud case. Shut up,  </p>
<p begin="01:29:18.640" end="01:29:28.000" style="s2">you clueless fool. Who gave you this insignia? <br />Take me to them now. It was brought by them.</p>
