<p begin="01:29:40.640" end="01:29:46.000" style="s2">Where did you get this? Someone gave it to us. <br />They said this can command the Silver Wolf Legion  </p>
<p begin="01:29:46.000" end="01:29:50.240" style="s2">to fight the Witch Hunter Court and protect the <br />Ashford family. How many troops do you want to  </p>
<p begin="01:29:50.240" end="01:29:57.120" style="s2">deploy? You&#39;re willing to help? Well, the more <br />the better. The more the better. But if it&#39;s an  </p>
