<p begin="01:30:10.480" end="01:30:17.360" style="s2">imagine. Arthur wasn&#39;t lying after all. Miss <br />Evelyn, you may return home in peace. With the  </p>
<p begin="01:30:17.360" end="01:30:22.560" style="s2">Silver Wolf Legion here, the Witch Hunter Court <br />will not touch the Ashford family. Thank you so  </p>
<p begin="01:30:22.560" end="01:30:31.440" style="s2">much, Mr. Gareth. You saved us. [music] We&#39;ll be <br />on our way. Mr. Gareth, are we really going to go  </p>
