<p begin="01:32:16.480" end="01:32:25.120" style="s2">I&#39;ll go visit Mr. Gareth. What&#39;s the point? You <br />don&#39;t even have the insignia anymore. We need to  </p>
<p begin="01:32:25.120" end="01:32:36.400" style="s2">prepare for the worst and rely on ourselves. We&#39;ll <br />take on the witch hunter court on our own. Evelyn,</p>
