<p begin="02:01:17.600" end="02:01:33.120" style="s2">something you need to worry about. Say yes and <br />the 500 billion deal is yours. or you give up.</p>
<p begin="02:01:57.600" end="02:02:03.760" style="s2">500 billion pound [music] deal. Not 500 billion. <br />Not even50 trillion pounds would make me sell  </p>
<p begin="02:02:03.760" end="02:02:08.880" style="s2">him. Arthur is [music] a bit reckless, sure, <br />but I&#39;m not divorcing him. Thanks for the tea.  </p>
<p begin="02:02:08.880" end="02:02:17.560" style="s2">What if I use that 500 billion to pressure Arthur <br />instead? [music] Then you&#39;ll end up with nothing.</p>
<p begin="02:02:17.560" end="02:02:28.720" style="s2">[music] If he could be <br />bought, you wouldn&#39;t need me.</p>
<p begin="02:02:28.720" end="02:02:34.800" style="s2">Wait. [music]</p>
<p begin="02:02:34.800" end="02:02:39.280" style="s2">All right. You win.</p>
<p begin="02:02:42.920" end="02:02:43.920" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="02:02:43.920" end="02:02:54.880" style="s2">Take the contract,</p>
<p begin="02:02:54.880" end="02:03:06.240" style="s2">but I never agreed to your <br />condition. No strings attached.</p>
<p begin="02:03:06.240" end="02:03:10.160" style="s2">Then why are you helping me? What exactly is <br />your relationship with Arthur? You&#39;ll know  </p>
<p begin="02:03:10.160" end="02:03:19.760" style="s2">the answer in 3 days. In 3 days, Ashford <br />may not even exist anymore. Don&#39;t be so  </p>
<p begin="02:03:19.760" end="02:03:25.520" style="s2">pessimistic. 3 days from now, you&#39;ll realize <br />how valuable your decision today truly was.  </p>
<p begin="02:03:25.520" end="02:03:34.640" style="s2">Something you can&#39;t even imagine. A lucky <br />woman without even realizing it. Go on.</p>
<p begin="02:03:40.080" end="02:03:44.720" style="s2">Grandpa, Dad, I secured a 500 billion pound <br />investment from Grey Capital. This isn&#39;t just  </p>
<p begin="02:03:44.720" end="02:03:52.400" style="s2">enough to save Ashen Group and the Red Dragon <br />Syndicate. We can actually strike back now.</p>
<p begin="02:03:52.400" end="02:04:03.680" style="s2">This is huge news. Why aren&#39;t you</p>
<p begin="02:04:03.680" end="02:04:09.120" style="s2">Did it arrive?</p>
<p begin="02:04:09.120" end="02:04:16.800" style="s2">This was sent over by Blackthornne. <br />It&#39;s basically a death notice.</p>
<p begin="02:04:16.800" end="02:04:23.600" style="s2">I had Aiden sent it with Star Crown level <br />experts on both sides. Even the silver wolf  </p>
<p begin="02:04:23.600" end="02:04:27.040" style="s2">commander would avoid it entirely. No <br />one would walk in wiltingly. You really  </p>
<p begin="02:04:27.040" end="02:04:30.560" style="s2">should stop talking big like that. <br />Right. Do what you need to do. Three  </p>
<p begin="02:04:30.560" end="02:04:37.280" style="s2">days from now at the Star Crown grand <br />ceremony, everything will be settled.</p>
<p begin="02:04:37.280" end="02:04:42.400" style="s2">I want to ask you something. Who exactly is <br />Vivian? My student. I told you that before.  </p>
<p begin="02:04:42.400" end="02:04:46.080" style="s2">Don&#39;t you remember your student? A student would <br />ask you to divorce your wife so she can be with  </p>
<p begin="02:04:46.080" end="02:04:49.440" style="s2">you. And I just realized something. Gray Capital <br />is literally named after your surname. I used to  </p>
<p begin="02:04:49.440" end="02:04:52.080" style="s2">think it was just a coincidence. Now tell me <br />the truth. What exactly is going on between  </p>
<p begin="02:04:52.080" end="02:04:56.720" style="s2">you two? Oh, what&#39;s this? Are you jealous? I <br />shut up. I&#39;m not jealous. I was just asking.  </p>
<p begin="02:04:56.720" end="02:05:01.440" style="s2">That&#39;s all. All I don&#39;t care at all. Not even <br />a little. By the way, where&#39;s the old man? He&#39;s  </p>
<p begin="02:05:01.440" end="02:05:05.280" style="s2">with Leon at the airport. We&#39;ve got a private <br />jet waiting. As soon as Malcolm is confirmed,  </p>
<p begin="02:05:05.280" end="02:05:09.120" style="s2">Star Crown Guardian will escape during the <br />Celebration Chaos and fly out immediately. So,  </p>
<p begin="02:05:09.120" end="02:05:16.480" style="s2">that&#39;s why they were acting so secretly. If <br />they don&#39;t show up, they&#39;ll miss a perfect show.</p>
<p begin="02:05:20.320" end="02:05:26.720" style="s2">Get lost. This is the star crown ceremony. <br />You think you belong here? If I&#39;m not here,  </p>
<p begin="02:05:26.720" end="02:05:31.840" style="s2">this ceremony doesn&#39;t happen. Still talking <br />big, huh? This is the ceremony to crown the  </p>
<p begin="02:05:31.840" end="02:05:40.000" style="s2">star guardian. Can&#39;t happen without you. What? <br />Are you the star crown guardian or something?</p>
<p begin="02:05:40.000" end="02:05:50.080" style="s2">Seven days are up. Today is your end. <br />I have no time for your nonsense.</p>
<p begin="02:05:50.080" end="02:05:54.400" style="s2">That&#39;s him, Victor. The surviving member of <br />the Gray family. And the ones beside him are  </p>
<p begin="02:05:54.400" end="02:06:00.480" style="s2">Evelyn and Roland. So, you&#39;re that gray bastard <br />in Ashford&#39;s trash? You killed my father and my  </p>
<p begin="02:06:00.480" end="02:06:04.800" style="s2">brother, and you still dare show your face <br />here? Wait, wasn&#39;t this invitation sent by  </p>
<p begin="02:06:04.800" end="02:06:10.240" style="s2">Blackhawk? You think people like you are worthy of <br />a Blackhorn invitation? I told you the invitation  </p>
<p begin="02:06:10.240" end="02:06:18.880" style="s2">came through Aiden. Now, do you believe me? <br />still flirting in front of me. Take them down.</p>
<p begin="02:06:18.880" end="02:06:26.480" style="s2">Victor, what makes you think <br />you can disrespect my master?</p>
<p begin="02:06:26.480" end="02:06:32.240" style="s2">Why is Viven here? And her master? Are you really <br />her master? She trained under me for about a year.  </p>
<p begin="02:06:32.240" end="02:06:37.280" style="s2">The legendary trillion pound business queen <br />Viven is Arthur&#39;s student. And you actually  </p>
<p begin="02:06:37.280" end="02:06:41.920" style="s2">believe that nonsense? What do you mean? Rich <br />people always get into weird mysticism. Maybe  </p>
<p begin="02:06:41.920" end="02:06:45.520" style="s2">Vivian visited some old Towel Tower Academy <br />and casually called Damas. That&#39;s all it is.  </p>
<p begin="02:06:45.520" end="02:06:49.760" style="s2">You actually took it seriously. If that&#39;s true, <br />then why does she know so much about the Gray  </p>
<p begin="02:06:49.760" end="02:06:54.480" style="s2">family survivor? Probably because she likes him. <br />You&#39;re actually believing them. This is my hotel,  </p>
<p begin="02:06:54.480" end="02:06:57.280" style="s2">my territory. If I want to deal with <br />Vladimir here, no one has the right  </p>
<p begin="02:06:57.280" end="02:07:01.920" style="s2">to interfere. Sorry. This hotel is mine now. <br />What are you talking about? One minute ago,  </p>
<p begin="02:07:01.920" end="02:07:09.200" style="s2">I acquired this hotel. From this moment on, I make <br />the rules here. Vivian, first you support Ashurn  </p>
<p begin="02:07:09.200" end="02:07:12.560" style="s2">Group and the Red Dragon Syndicate against us. <br />Now you&#39;re trying to take over the hotel hosting  </p>
<p begin="02:07:12.560" end="02:07:16.800" style="s2">the star crown ceremony. Are you really willing <br />to go to war just for that pretty boy? Arthur is  </p>
<p begin="02:07:16.800" end="02:07:21.680" style="s2">my arcane mentor. Without him, there would be <br />no me today. The trillions under Grey Capital  </p>
<p begin="02:07:21.680" end="02:07:26.720" style="s2">are merely assets I manage on his behalf. As for <br />Blackthornne, we were never on peaceful terms to  </p>
<p begin="02:07:26.720" end="02:07:32.320" style="s2">begin with. What? That&#39;s impossible. Sir, this <br />hotel my wedding gift to you both. Please accept  </p>
<p begin="02:07:32.320" end="02:07:36.640" style="s2">it. You little troublemaker. Finally learning how <br />to behave, huh? So, you&#39;re really her arcane mint  </p>
<p begin="02:07:36.640" end="02:07:40.800" style="s2">and gray capital is yours? Then what exactly are <br />you teaching her? Star mapping, alchemy runes,  </p>
<p begin="02:07:40.800" end="02:07:45.760" style="s2">capital forecasting, just the basics. Ma&#39;am, <br />you&#39;d better watch out. I&#39;ll snatch Arthur away  </p>
<p begin="02:07:45.760" end="02:07:50.960" style="s2">whenever I can. I won&#39;t give you that chance. Good <br />girl. Use all available resources. Crush every  </p>
<p begin="02:07:50.960" end="02:07:55.840" style="s2">Blackthornne asset. Understood, sir. Within 1 <br />hour, every Blackthornne asset will rebrand under  </p>
<p begin="02:07:55.840" end="02:08:01.040" style="s2">Grey Capital. Arrogant fool. You think money alone <br />makes you untouchable? Money can&#39;t do everything,  </p>
<p begin="02:08:01.040" end="02:08:08.480" style="s2">but it can take everything from you. You <br />little punk. Stop acting so high and mighty.</p>
<p begin="02:08:08.480" end="02:08:14.480" style="s2">Then let&#39;s see how you plan to <br />take everything from Blackthornne.</p>
<p begin="02:08:14.480" end="02:08:19.760" style="s2">Malcolm is here. Arthur, you&#39;re dead now. Malcolm <br />is a star crown level warrior. Let&#39;s see how  </p>
<p begin="02:08:19.760" end="02:08:25.520" style="s2">you&#39;re going to fight him. Ignorance. Malcolm <br />is here. Don&#39;t do anything reckless. Fine,  </p>
<p begin="02:08:25.520" end="02:08:29.440" style="s2">then I&#39;ll make sure he experiences real despair <br />before he dies. So, you&#39;re the surviving rat  </p>
<p begin="02:08:29.440" end="02:08:34.640" style="s2">from the Gray family 10 years ago. Hand over <br />the Raven King&#39;s secret vault. I might let you  </p>
<p begin="02:08:34.640" end="02:08:38.320" style="s2">die a quicker death. Malcolm, you really <br />rushed here just to offer me your head,  </p>
<p begin="02:08:38.320" end="02:08:46.160" style="s2">didn&#39;t you? The Star Crown ceremony is not a place <br />for you to act wild. Aiden, you killed my son,  </p>
<p begin="02:08:46.160" end="02:08:51.280" style="s2">and you still dare to show your face? Do you think <br />you&#39;ll get away with it? I am here to complete the  </p>
<p begin="02:08:51.280" end="02:09:02.160" style="s2">Star Crown Guardian coronation ceremony with the <br />official seal and portrait of the new guardian.</p>
<p begin="02:09:02.160" end="02:09:07.760" style="s2">Very well. Once I become the true star crown <br />guardian, I will deal with you properly. You  </p>
<p begin="02:09:07.760" end="02:09:12.560" style="s2">trying to become the star crown guardian? There is <br />only one person in this world worthy of that title  </p>
<p begin="02:09:12.560" end="02:09:22.880" style="s2">and that is my master. Tell me which mystic tower <br />did you train under? Who is your master? Student  </p>
<p begin="02:09:22.880" end="02:09:30.320" style="s2">Aiden bows to master. Stand up. Silver wolf <br />commander is also your disciple. You didn&#39;t tie  </p>
<p begin="02:09:30.320" end="02:09:35.120" style="s2">me. I never did. He&#39;s the silver wolf commander&#39;s <br />master. Isn&#39;t he just some loser mage from Raven  </p>
<p begin="02:09:35.120" end="02:09:40.320" style="s2">Tower? What the hell is going on? A good liar&#39;s <br />student doesn&#39;t prove anything. That doesn&#39;t make  </p>
<p begin="02:09:40.320" end="02:09:47.760" style="s2">you strong. Then Conrad was killed by you, wasn&#39;t <br />it? Blood feuds are never handled by others. And  </p>
<p begin="02:09:47.760" end="02:09:53.200" style="s2">Victor, too. Just how strong are you? Are you some <br />kind of hunter mage? I&#39;m not a hunter mage. I am  </p>
<p begin="02:09:53.200" end="02:09:58.240" style="s2">the absolute star- law executor. Absurd. No matter <br />how strong you are, you&#39;re still within the magic  </p>
<p begin="02:09:58.240" end="02:10:02.960" style="s2">system. You&#39;re not fit for the star crown seat. <br />Only my master is qualified for the star crown  </p>
<p begin="02:10:02.960" end="02:10:08.960" style="s2">seat. I have already broken through star crown <br />realm. Controlling star law is within my grasp.  </p>
<p begin="02:10:08.960" end="02:10:17.520" style="s2">Passing the trial will be effortless. Then let him <br />try. Candidates for the star crown must release  </p>
<p begin="02:10:17.520" end="02:10:23.200" style="s2">their star vein energy and bow three times towards <br />the sacred portrait. If the portrait recognizes  </p>
<p begin="02:10:23.200" end="02:10:29.680" style="s2">them, it will shine with divine light. The <br />strength of them determines the final selection.</p>
<p begin="02:10:31.280" end="02:10:44.080" style="s2">The Star Crown Guardian title <br />belongs to me. I&#39;ll go first.</p>
<p begin="02:10:44.080" end="02:10:48.240" style="s2">The First Guardians portrait portrait has <br />responded. He&#39;s been acknowledged. He is the Star  </p>
<p begin="02:10:48.240" end="02:10:53.440" style="s2">Crown Guardian. We&#39;re done. There&#39;s no escape from <br />Blackthornne&#39;s rule now. You really thought Arthur  </p>
<p begin="02:10:53.440" end="02:10:59.120" style="s2">could stand against Blackthornne? Just go ahead <br />and die with him. Don&#39;t forget you&#39;re in Asheford,  </p>
<p begin="02:10:59.120" end="02:11:05.600" style="s2">too. The Asheford family belongs only to Blair. <br />They&#39;re dying soon. No need to waste time on them.  </p>
<p begin="02:11:05.600" end="02:11:12.720" style="s2">Once I obtain the Star Crown seal, the coronation <br />will be complete. Stop. You are not qualified,  </p>
<p begin="02:11:12.720" end="02:11:19.040" style="s2">and you are not worthy to touch that seal. H. The <br />First Guardian has already acknowledged me. Your  </p>
<p begin="02:11:19.040" end="02:11:25.360" style="s2">words mean nothing. Once I become the true Star <br />Crown Guardian, I&#39;ll deal with you personally.  </p>
<p begin="02:11:26.000" end="02:11:30.400" style="s2">We need to leave now. Once Malcolm <br />becomes Star Crown Guardian,  </p>
<p begin="02:11:30.400" end="02:11:42.680" style="s2">he&#39;ll be untouchable. We won&#39;t have anywhere <br />left to stand. It&#39;s not going to happen.</p>
<p begin="02:11:42.680" end="02:11:48.880" style="s2">[screaming]</p>
<p begin="02:11:48.880" end="02:11:56.480" style="s2">How How is this possible? Why is the Star Crown <br />Seal rejecting me? He was already acknowledged  </p>
<p begin="02:11:56.480" end="02:12:01.760" style="s2">by the First Guardian&#39;s portrait. So why would the <br />Star Crown seal reject him like this? Because the  </p>
<p begin="02:12:01.760" end="02:12:06.080" style="s2">First Guardian was blind. That&#39;s why he chose <br />the wrong person. That&#39;s [snorts] the First  </p>
<p begin="02:12:06.080" end="02:12:10.320" style="s2">Guardian&#39;s portrait you&#39;re talking about. <br />How can you say something like that? Wait  </p>
<p begin="02:12:10.320" end="02:12:20.320" style="s2">here. I&#39;ll claim the Star Crown seat for you <br />and crown you as the Star Crown Lady. What?</p>
<p begin="02:12:20.320" end="02:12:26.880" style="s2">Bastard. What are you trying to do? Take <br />the seal and become the star crown guardian.  </p>
<p begin="02:12:26.880" end="02:12:35.840" style="s2">Ridiculous. Even I am rejected by the seal. <br />What makes you think you can take it? Come.</p>
<p begin="02:12:35.840" end="02:12:46.880" style="s2">[gasps] It actually obeyed him. Even Malcolm <br />couldn&#39;t make it submit. How is it going to  </p>
<p begin="02:12:46.880" end="02:12:55.280" style="s2">him willingly? How did you do that? Because I <br />am the rightful Star Crown Guardian. The seal  </p>
<p begin="02:12:55.280" end="02:13:00.240" style="s2">was brought by Aiden. He must have strigged <br />it somehow. If you weren&#39;t acknowledged,  </p>
<p begin="02:13:00.240" end="02:13:07.920" style="s2">then you are not qualified. What could possibly <br />knock out a Star Crown Realm expert? Rules are  </p>
<p begin="02:13:07.920" end="02:13:14.400" style="s2">rules. Without the portrait&#39;s acknowledgement, <br />you are not qualified. I am the Star Crown  </p>
<p begin="02:13:14.400" end="02:13:21.200" style="s2">Guardian. No one can refuse to acknowledge <br />me. Not even it. You&#39;re insulting the First  </p>
<p begin="02:13:21.200" end="02:13:35.680" style="s2">Guardian. You claim I lack qualification. Then <br />tell me, do you obey or not? Do you submit?</p>
<p begin="02:13:35.680" end="02:13:39.520" style="s2">You&#39;re bold enough against Blackthornne <br />already. But to speak that way to the First  </p>
<p begin="02:13:39.520" end="02:13:43.680" style="s2">Star Crown Guardian, if he gets angry, <br />do you realize what that means? Aiden,  </p>
<p begin="02:13:43.680" end="02:13:48.400" style="s2">you&#39;re in charge of this ceremony. He&#39;s insulted <br />the First Star Crown Guardian. Detain him at once.  </p>
<p begin="02:13:48.400" end="02:13:52.400" style="s2">My master correcting the first star crown <br />guardian is the guardian&#39;s honor. What right  </p>
<p begin="02:13:52.400" end="02:13:59.520" style="s2">does he have to lecture the first star crown <br />guardian? What right I have. I am the new chief  </p>
<p begin="02:13:59.520" end="02:14:05.520" style="s2">mage of Raven Tower, the strongest Star-Lord <br />executor of this generation. I protect the  </p>
<p begin="02:14:05.520" end="02:14:09.840" style="s2">Star-Lords of Britain for eternity. Even <br />if all past chief mages came together,  </p>
<p begin="02:14:09.840" end="02:14:14.480" style="s2">they wouldn&#39;t match me. That&#39;s what gives me <br />the right. I thought you were a janitor at  </p>
<p begin="02:14:14.480" end="02:14:22.960" style="s2">Raven Tower. How did you become chief mage and a <br />Star-Lord executor? I told you Arthur was never  </p>
<p begin="02:14:22.960" end="02:14:28.560" style="s2">ordinary. Do you believe that now? Too bad the <br />old master isn&#39;t here to see this. Impossible.  </p>
<p begin="02:14:28.560" end="02:14:34.880" style="s2">It&#39;s a lie. He&#39;s bluffering again. Impossible. <br />There is no such thing as a Star-Lord executor.  </p>
<p begin="02:14:34.880" end="02:14:42.880" style="s2">And I already have eyes on Raven Tower. The <br />new chief maget has never even left the tower.</p>
<p begin="02:14:42.880" end="02:14:57.040" style="s2">The first guardian is manifesting. He is furious <br />at your lies. You&#39;re finished. Do you submit,</p>
<p begin="02:14:57.040" end="02:15:00.320" style="s2">Lord Archment? I submit. With your protection,  </p>
<p begin="02:15:00.320" end="02:15:10.560" style="s2">the British Star Laws will endure forever. <br />I can rest in peace. Impossible. So,  </p>
<p begin="02:15:10.560" end="02:15:19.840" style="s2">the First Guardian truly acknowledged it. I <br />really married the Arkmaster of Raven Tower.</p>
<p begin="02:15:19.840" end="02:15:24.000" style="s2">I am the Star Crown Guardian. <br />I judge on behalf of the Star  </p>
<p begin="02:15:24.000" end="02:15:33.200" style="s2">Laws. Black Thrones cruelty and <br />corruption cannot be allowed.</p>
<p begin="02:15:33.200" end="02:15:40.160" style="s2">Heaven forbids it. Every direct [music] <br />descendant of Malcolm will be executed.</p>
<p begin="02:15:42.240" end="02:15:49.280" style="s2">You slaughtered my entire lineage. Even if <br />you are a god, I will still slay you. I let  </p>
<p begin="02:15:49.280" end="02:16:02.320" style="s2">you live because you are the one who destroyed <br />my family. Your death will not be merciful. Die.</p>
<p begin="02:16:02.320" end="02:16:05.520" style="s2">In the name of the star laws, <br />with thunder as testimony,  </p>
<p begin="02:16:05.520" end="02:16:11.880" style="s2">the ancient pack descends. Summoned by the sword.</p>
<p begin="02:16:11.880" end="02:16:15.760" style="s2">[screaming]</p>
<p begin="02:16:15.760" end="02:16:23.200" style="s2">Mom, Dad, everyone. Blackthornne is over. Malcolm <br />is gone. You can finally rest [music] in peace. I  </p>
<p begin="02:16:23.200" end="02:16:28.240" style="s2">could have been Starcrown lady. I was the <br />most foolish woman alive. He is the chief  </p>
<p begin="02:16:28.240" end="02:16:36.000" style="s2">mage. He wasn&#39;t lying. Then I&#39;m definitely <br />going to die. What? My family collapsed.  </p>
<p begin="02:16:36.000" end="02:16:41.760" style="s2">Everyone is dead. How is this possible? <br />Lord Guardian, please don&#39;t kill me. I  </p>
<p begin="02:16:41.760" end="02:16:51.840" style="s2">don&#39;t want to die. The [music] star laws <br />may forgive once, but humans in does not.</p>
<p begin="02:16:51.840" end="02:17:01.600" style="s2">So it really is judgment by the heavens. <br />This time it wasn&#39;t me. It was the stars.</p>
<p begin="02:17:01.600" end="02:17:04.800" style="s2">Here, I promised you I&#39;ll <br />make you the most respected  </p>
<p begin="02:17:04.800" end="02:17:10.240" style="s2">woman in the world. I&#39;ve kept that promise.</p>
<p begin="02:17:10.240" end="02:17:11.025" style="s2">[applause]</p>
</div>
</body>
</tt>
